# Disease classifier model card: disease_best.keras

## Purpose
Classifies an accepted leaf photo as healthy or one of three foliar diseases, with a confidence, as one input to fusion.

## Version and files
- Version: {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::version}}
- File: {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::file}} ({{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::bytes}} bytes)
- sha256: {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::sha256}}
- Weights are not in git. Location: {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::weights_location}}
- TensorFlow {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::tf_version}}. Input: {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::input.size}}x{{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::input.size}} RGB, preprocessing "{{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::input.preprocess}}".
- Classes, in model output order: {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::classes[0]}}, {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::classes[1]}}, {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::classes[2]}}, {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::classes[3]}}.

## Data
PlantVillage maize images (controlled conditions), split into train, validation and test. Train images per class: common_rust {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::train_counts.common_rust}}, gray_leaf_spot {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::train_counts.gray_leaf_spot}}, healthy {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::train_counts.healthy}}, northern_leaf_blight {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::train_counts.northern_leaf_blight}}. Validation images per class: common_rust {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::val_counts.common_rust}}, gray_leaf_spot {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::val_counts.gray_leaf_spot}}, healthy {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::val_counts.healthy}}, northern_leaf_blight {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::val_counts.northern_leaf_blight}}. Test n = {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_test/metrics.json::n}}.

## Training
Source: `models/core_classifier/training_run.json`, trained with `scripts/train_image_classifier.py` in Colab. EfficientNetB0 with ImageNet weights, two phases: head only ({{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::hyperparameters.epochs_head}} epochs allowed, learning rate {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::hyperparameters.lr_head}}), then the last {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::hyperparameters.unfreeze_layers}} base layers unfrozen with BatchNormalization kept frozen ({{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::hyperparameters.epochs_finetune}} epochs allowed, learning rate {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::hyperparameters.lr_finetune}}). Epochs actually run: phase 1 {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::epochs_run.phase1}}, phase 2 {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::epochs_run.phase2}} (early stopping). Batch size {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::hyperparameters.batch_size}}, seed {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::hyperparameters.seed}}, balanced class weights, TensorFlow {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::tensorflow_version}}. Best validation accuracy {{models/core_classifier/training_run.json::best_val_accuracy::.4f}}. The checkpoint was chosen on validation, so validation figures are optimistic.

