## Thresholds
- System threshold `t_disease` = {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::thresholds.t_disease}}. This is the RAP fusion bound below which a result is uncertain.
- Operating point selected on the validation split by a rule fixed beforehand: {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::thresholds.t_disease_validation_selected}}. Fusion overrides it with the stricter value above.
- At {{models/core_classifier/manifest.json::thresholds.t_disease}} on the validation split: coverage {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_val/threshold_table.csv::[threshold=0.6].coverage::.4f}}, accuracy on accepted images {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_val/threshold_table.csv::[threshold=0.6].accuracy_on_accepted::.4f}}, diseased leaves accepted as healthy {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_val/threshold_table.csv::[threshold=0.6].sick_accepted_as_healthy::d}}.
- At the same threshold on the test split: coverage {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_test/metrics.json::confidence_analysis[threshold=0.6].coverage::.4f}}, accuracy on accepted images {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_test/metrics.json::confidence_analysis[threshold=0.6].accuracy_on_accepted::.4f}}.
- Validation threshold table: `results/disease_best/disease_v1_val/threshold_table.csv`.

## Known failure modes
- Gray leaf spot and northern leaf blight are confused with each other: {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_test/metrics.json::confusion_matrix[1][3]}} gray leaf spot images called northern leaf blight, {{results/disease_best/disease_v1_test/metrics.json::confusion_matrix[3][1]}} the other way round (test split). Both are foliar diseases, so a sick leaf is still flagged as sick, but the disease label, and therefore the advice, can be wrong.
- Gray leaf spot has the lowest confidence: about one validation photo in five asks for a retake at the system threshold.

## Limitations
- PlantVillage images are photographed under controlled conditions. No real-world test of this model has been run, so performance on phone photos is unknown and likely lower.
- A perceptual-hash leakage check between train and test found no near-duplicate pairs. Its console output was not saved as a file (`docs/limitations.md`, section Disease classifier). It catches near-identical images only.
- Covers three foliar diseases and healthy leaves. Other diseases, pests and deficiencies are not recognised.